    <string name="about_methods_title">How it is calculated</string>
    <string name="about_methods">Planetary positions from the Swiss Ephemeris. Vedic: sidereal zodiac (Lahiri by default), whole-sign houses, Vimshottari and Yogini dashas, Shadbala, Ashtakavarga, Jaimini, KP, Tajika Varshaphal and Lal Kitab (1952). Western: tropical zodiac with aspects, transits, progressions, solar return and zodiacal releasing. Chinese BaZi on the solar calendar. Numerology: Pythagorean, Chaldean and Indian. Forecasts count only where several systems agree.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_title">Please note</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Readings describe traditional tendencies, not certainties. They are not medical, legal, financial or psychological advice; for health, always see a doctor. Remedies are optional and promise no result.</string>
