    <string name="tour1_title">Your Kundli in seconds</string>
    <string name="tour1_body">Enter a birth date, time and place. The app draws the North or South Indian chart with planets, dashas and yogas, worked out on your phone.</string>
    <string name="tour2_title">Forecast and full reading</string>
    <string name="tour2_body">See the three-year forecast for marriage, work, family and energy, year by year, and open a full reading you can save or share as a PDF.</string>
    <string name="tour3_title">Kundli Milan and Muhurat</string>
    <string name="tour3_body">Match two Kundlis with Guna Milan and the Mangal check, find a good time for an important beginning, and read the numbers in a name.</string>
    <string name="tour4_title">Switch person any time</string>
    <string name="tour4_body">Tap the name at the top of a screen to pick a saved Kundli, or tap + New to add someone. Birth details stay on this phone and work without the internet.</string>
