    <string name="share_subject">Gaurav Jyotish: Kundli, Milan and Muhurat app</string>
    <string name="share_message">I use Gaurav Jyotish for Kundli, Kundli Milan, Muhurat and numerology. It works without the internet and keeps birth details on the phone. Get it on Google Play: %1$s</string>
    <string name="rate_app">Rate the app</string>
    <string name="rate_app_sub">A rating on Google Play helps others find it</string>
    <string name="settings_help_group">Help and sharing</string>
    <string name="faq_time_q">Why does the exact birth time matter?</string>
    <string name="faq_time_a">The Lagna moves to the next sign about every two hours, and the houses and dasha dates follow it. A time from the birth certificate is best. If you only know it roughly, choose Approximate or Not known under \"How sure is the time?\" and read the Lagna, houses and dasha dates as a guide only.</string>
    <string name="faq_place_q">My village is not in the list</string>
    <string name="faq_place_a">Choose the nearest town. A few kilometres make almost no difference to the chart. You can also enter the latitude and longitude yourself.</string>
    <string name="faq_switch_q">How do I see another person\'s Kundli?</string>
    <string name="faq_switch_a">Tap the name at the top of the Kundli, Forecast, Numbers or Reading screen and pick from your saved Kundlis, or tap + New. To edit or delete someone, open Saved Kundlis from Home.</string>
    <string name="faq_style_q">North Indian or South Indian chart?</string>
    <string name="faq_style_a">Both show the same chart in a different layout. Change it on the Kundli screen or in Settings under Chart style.</string>
    <string name="faq_ayanamsa_q">Which ayanamsa does the app use?</string>
    <string name="faq_ayanamsa_a">Lahiri (Chitrapaksha), the standard in India. You can switch to Raman, KP or True Chitra in Settings; every chart is worked out again.</string>
    <string name="faq_data_q">Does it need the internet? Where is my data?</string>
    <string name="faq_data_a">No internet is needed. All calculations happen on your phone and birth details stay on it. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you choose to email your registration details or share something yourself.</string>
    <string name="faq_certain_q">Is the forecast certain?</string>
    <string name="faq_certain_a">No. Jyotish shows tendencies and easier and harder periods; it does not guarantee results. Use it as guidance alongside your own judgement.</string>
    <string name="faq_full_q">How do I get the full version?</string>
    <string name="faq_full_a">Open Settings and tap Unlock the full version. From Google Play it is a single purchase; on a new phone, tap Restore purchase with the same Google account.</string>
